    "body": "## Chat05B PR #461 - final merge-gate evidence check (2026-10-31)\n\n**Audited exact HEAD:** `595532694fb2556637b55b27671237b41d52b7a6`  \n**Base/current main:** `00ce2baca8dca177dfadffcb8bccbae11bca118f`  \n**PR:** OPEN / DRAFT / UNMERGED; 5 scoped files. No code changes in this audit.\n\n### Reproducible source/CI evidence\n- [Immutable Chat05B lifecycle + explicit Worker-stamp deadline contract](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/blob/595532694fb2556637b55b27671237b41d52b7a6/gameplay-server/CHAT05B_CONTRACT.md).\n- [D1 SQL guard and immutable sidecar](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/blob/595532694fb2556637b55b27671237b41d52b7a6/gameplay-server/migrations/0011_chat05b_vote_deadlines_and_fill.sql).\n- [Workerd/D1 delayed native INSERT after timestamp capture, matrix, close/replay/restart tests](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/blob/595532694fb2556637b55b27671237b41d52b7a6/gameplay-server/test/private_api_local_test.mjs).\n- [PR private-API workflow](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/41169584018) and [push private-API workflow](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/41169580000): both completed/success on exact HEAD. The complete GitHub checks API shows **8/8 completed/success**: PR + push runs of `sqlite-cas`, `wrangler-local-d1`, `private-api-local`, and `capture`.\n- Directly inspected action-job logs confirm D1 migrations 0001-0011 and local test PASS.\n\n### Independent `critical_reviewer` evidence - BLOCKING\nPR description asserts `PASS_CRITICAL_REVIEW`, report ID `CR461-FINAL-20261031-5955326`, local agent path `<HOME>/chat05b_pr461_final_review`. **However the complete independent reviewer report is not present in the accessible PR conversation/formal reviews, repository code search, referenced workflow artifacts (both lists empty), or reviewed CI job logs.** That path is local to a Codex execution environment and is not an accessible evidence link for another reviewer.\n\n**Required from the existing Codex task (no code changes requested):** publish the **actual unmodified independent `critical_reviewer` report** as a comment on this existing PR or upload a directly accessible persistent artifact and link it here. Include exact reviewed HEAD, independent reviewer identifier/run, report text, findings/negative tests and `PASS_CRITICAL_REVIEW` conclusion. A coordinator's comments or a self-reported PASS in PR description are not substitutes. If the original reviewer report is unavailable, re-run independent `critical_reviewer` on the same HEAD and publish the new report with provenance. Do not fabricate or reconstruct its words.\n\n### Deadline contract confirmed, not changed\nThe strict predicate is **trusted Worker timestamp < persisted deadline**, *not* D1 commit time. An in-flight D1 write may persist after wall-clock D if stamped D-1 and the sidecar remains open; if a close commits first the insert fails. The delayed `.run()` hold/release regression tests this exact behavior. Owner should explicitly accept this intentional cutoff policy when authorizing merge.\n\n**Merge verdict right now: NOT READY FOR MERGE** because the mandatory independent critical-review evidence cannot yet be independently inspected (and owner has not separately authorized merge). At source/CI level the original two findings are addressed; this is an **evidence gate**, not a request to redo the fixes. No merge, deploy, production/D1 changes or new PR is authorized. Shared `gameplay-server/src/worker.js` remains serialized.",
